 <h3><u>Ya ali tera shukriya</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Shukria ya ALI -4<br> ALI ALI hum dum ALI ALI ALI ALI-2<br> ALI MOLA -5<br> ALI-ALI<br> ALI ALI hum dum ALI ALI<br> ALI-2</p> 
  <p>Sher E KHUDA nafs E KHUDA,<br> Haajat rawa'n mushkil kusha,<br> Karte hain sab NABI AS WALI<br> Karta hai KIBRIYA<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4<br> Padhti hai ye Kabeh ki-2 diwar qaseeda tera.<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-2</p> 
  <p>1) Ho ik-ik karke sare rishte chod rahe the daaman,<br> Waqt e qaza tha mai tanha tha rukne lagi thi dhadkan,<br> Ay MOLA gar tum nahi aate-2<br> Maut se mai mar jata.<br> Ya ALI tera shukria<br> ALI haq-5<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4</p> 
  <p>2) Han isse behtar hamd e KHUDA kya koi bhala likhega,<br> Jisko ALI sajda karta hai khud wo KHUDA kya hoga,<br> Kafi hai Tauheed samajhne ko tera ik sajda.<br> Ya ALI tera shukria<br> ALI haq-5<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4</p> 
  <p>3) Han Kaabah kahan tha but khana tha aapne rakhli izzat,<br> Wo to kahiye BINT e ASAD ne karli khud hi zehmat,<br> Sehne ABU TALIB me warna Kaabah chal kar aata.<br> Ya ALI tera shukria<br> ALI haq-5<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4</p> 
  <p>4) Nad e ALI hai inka wazeefa khaibar O khandaq lori,<br> Maut se unko dar nahi lagta maut hai unse darti,<br> Zikr se Tere sher hua hai qaum ka baccha baccha<br> Ya ALI tera shukria<br> ALI haq-5<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4</p> 
  <p>5) Han ishq e ALI se ZAINABIYA azaad karaya usne,<br> Kya hain ALI k naukar ye dunia ko bataya usne,<br> Japd kahegi qabza karke dunia par HEZBOLLAH<br> Ya ALI tera shukria<br> ALI haq-5<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4</p> 
  <p>6) Kaise hain ye diwane kyo inko nahi lagta dar,<br> Maut bhi sakte me thi akhir kya hain ALI ke naukar,<br> Dekh k apni maut ko jab ye-2<br> Sibt e Jafer bola.<br> Ya ALI tera shukria<br> ALI haq-5<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4</p> 
  <p>7) Masjid me jab nam e KHUDA par bheek kisi ne mangi,<br> Hath badha kar dast e KHUDA ne apni angoothi dedi,<br> Akba sayil se pehle-2<br> Ye RAB e Akbar bola.<br> Ya ALI tera shukria-4<br> Ya ALI-4</p> 
